        "kind": "text",
        "text": "Bond-graph plant (D28): Vd/Vq MSe -> d/q 1-junctions (R_s, L_d/L_q) with the MGY cross-coupling and the q-axis MSe back-EMF -> GY k_t to the mechanical 1-junction. Two-mass: MJ -TF(1)-> S0(0) <-TF(1)- LJ, with C=1/k_c and R=c_c in parallel on the 1-junction KJ fed by S0. Switching: PwmInverter at 100 kHz on a 4 kHz carrier, 2 us dead time, 1.2 V drop. Sensor: 24-bit encoder, 1 kHz differenced speed estimate. Loop rates 8/1/0.2 kHz; one 8 kHz computation delay.",
